      "answer": 1,
      "solution": "\\(5.92\\times10^{-4}\\)",
      "working": "<p>The first factor must be at least 1 and less than 10. Move the decimal point four places to the right to get 5.92, so the power is negative.</p>\\[0.000592=5.92\\times10^{-4}.\\]",
