      "answer": 2,
      "solution": "\\(5.3\\times10^5\\)",
      "working": "<p>Rewrite both terms with the same power of 10 before adding the coefficients.</p>\\[(4.6+0.7)\\times10^5=5.3\\times10^5.\\]",
