      "answer": 1,
      "solution": "\\(8.76\\times10^8\\)",
      "working": "<p>Since \\(2.4\\times10^7=0.24\\times10^8\\),</p>\\[(9-0.24)\\times10^8=8.76\\times10^8.\\]",
