      "answer": 3,
      "solution": "\\(1.6\\times10^4\\)",
      "working": "<p>Multiply the coefficients and add the powers.</p>\\[(3.2\\times5)\\times10^{-4+7}=16\\times10^3=1.6\\times10^4.\\]",
