      "answer": 0,
      "solution": "\\(4\\times10^9\\)",
      "working": "<p>Divide the coefficients and subtract the denominator exponent, including its minus sign.</p>\\[\\frac{8.4}{2.1}\\times10^{6-(-3)}=4\\times10^9.\\]",
