        "\\(8.4\\times10^n\\)",
        "\\(3\\times10^{n-1}\\)",
        "\\(3\\times10^n\\)",
        "\\(1.44\\times10^n\\)"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "solution": "\\(3\\times10^n\\)",
      "working": "<p>Rewrite \\(6\\times10^{n-1}=0.6\\times10^n\\).</p>\\[(2.4+0.6)\\times10^n=3\\times10^n.\\]<p>The coefficient 3 is between 1 and 10, so this is standard form.</p>",
