      "answer": 3,
      "solution": "\\(27a^3b^9\\)",
      "working": "<p>Apply the power to every factor; multiply the indices when raising a power to a power.</p>\\[(3ab^3)^3=3^3a^3b^{3\\times3}=27a^3b^9.\\]",
      "source_ref": "Original"
    },
    {
      "id": "3iec-standard-indices-q12",
      "section": "Indices — Applying the laws",
      "title": "12",
      "prompt": "For \\(z\\ne0\\), evaluate \\(8z^0+2^{-3}\\). Give an exact fraction.",
      "options": [
        "\\(\\frac{65}{8}\\)",
        "\\(\\frac{9}{8}\\)",
        "\\(\\frac{63}{8}\\)",
        "\\(\\frac{1}{8}\\)"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "solution": "\\(\\frac{65}{8}\\)",
      "working": "<p>A non-zero base to the power zero equals 1, and a negative exponent means a reciprocal.</p>\\[z^0=1,\\qquad2^{-3}=\\frac{1}{2^3}=\\frac{1}{8}.\\]\\[8z^0+2^{-3}=8+\\frac{1}{8}=\\frac{65}{8}.\\]",
      "source_ref": "Original"
    },
    {
      "id": "3iec-standard-indices-q13",
      "section": "Indices — Applying the laws",
      "title": "13",
      "prompt": "Evaluate \\(64^{\\frac23}\\) exactly.",
      "options": [
        "\\(8\\)",
        "\\(16\\)",
