      "answer": 1,
      "solution": "\\(16\\)",
      "working": "<p>The denominator of the index gives the root, and the numerator gives the power.</p>\\[64^{\\frac{2}{3}}=(\\sqrt[3]{64})^2=4^2=16.\\]",
