      "section": "Indices — Challenge",
      "title": "15",
      "prompt": "Solve \\(5^x=125^{x-4}\\) for \\(x\\).",
      "options": [
        "\\(-6\\)",
        "\\(2\\)",
        "\\(12\\)",
        "\\(6\\)"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "solution": "\\(6\\)",
      "working": "<p>Since \\(125=5^3\\),</p>\\[5^x=5^{3(x-4)}.\\]<p>Equate the indices:</p>\\[x=3x-12\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad2x=12\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x=6.\\]",
